      "category": "offensive",
      "cost": "passive",
      "description": "<p>If Cephal critically succeeds at a jaws Strike against a foe or successfully hits a helpless foe with a jaws Strike, he gnaws upon the foe's flesh and drains its life force to bolster his own health. This restores @Damage[3d6[healing]] HP to Cephal (he gains any excess HP as temporary HP, and also becomes Quickened 1 during his next turn; he may use his extra action only to make a jaws Strike).</p>",
